---
import '../../styles/coaching-portal.css';
import '../../styles/coaching-wallet.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#06142d" />
    <title>Mon coaching — Sonny Court</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="cp-ambient" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="app-layout">
      <aside class="app-sidebar cp-glass">
        <a class="cp-brand" href="/"><span class="cp-mark">S</span><span>MON COACHING</span></a>
        <div class="role-identity">
          <span class="role-avatar student" data-student-avatar><span data-student-initials>CM</span></span>
          <span><small>Espace personnel</small><strong data-student-full-name>Claire Martin</strong></span>
        </div>
        <nav class="app-nav" aria-label="Navigation élève">
          <p>Mon espace</p>
          <a class="active" href="#accueil"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect></svg>Vue d’ensemble</a>
          <a href="/coaching/preparation"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6"></path></svg>Ma préparation</a>
          <a href="/coaching/reserver"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"></rect><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 10h18"></path></svg>Réserver</a>
          <a href="#historique"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg>Mes séances</a>
          <p>Mon wallet</p>
          <a href="/coaching/credits"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7H14a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>Ajouter des crédits</a>
          <a href="/coaching/compte"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg>Mon compte</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-foot"><strong>Ton espace reste personnel</strong><small>Les notes privées de <span data-coach-name>Romain</span> ne sont jamais affichées ici.</small><a href="#" data-logout>Se déconnecter</a></div>
      </aside>

      <main class="app-main" id="accueil">
        <header class="app-topbar">
          <div><p>Espace de <span data-student-first-name>Claire</span></p><h1>Mon coaching</h1></div>
          <div class="top-actions"><span class="cp-status">Accès personnel</span><a class="top-profile" href="/coaching/compte"><span class="role-avatar student" data-student-avatar><span data-student-initials>CM</span></span><span><strong data-student-first-name>Claire</strong><small>Mon compte</small></span></a></div>
        </header>

        <div class="app-content">
          <div class="content-wrap">
            <section class="student-hero">
              <article class="student-welcome cp-glass">
                <p class="cp-eyebrow">Bonjour <span data-student-first-name>Claire</span></p>
                <h2>Tu n’as pas besoin de tout porter <em>entre deux séances.</em></h2>
                <p>Retrouve ici uniquement ce qui t’aide à préparer la prochaine étape et à garder le mouvement engagé avec <span data-coach-name>Romain</span>.</p>
                <div class="page-actions"><a class="cp-button" data-next-action href="/coaching/preparation">Commencer ma préparation</a><a class="cp-button secondary" href="#historique">Voir mon parcours</a></div>
              </article>
              <article class="credit-card cp-glass">
                <p class="cp-eyebrow">Mon wallet</p>
                <div class="credit-visual" data-credit-visual><span><strong data-student-remaining>—</strong><small>crédits disponibles</small></span></div>
                <div class="credit-equivalence"><strong data-student-time>—</strong><small>1 crédit = 15 minutes</small></div>
                <a class="cp-button green small" href="/coaching/credits">Ajouter des crédits</a>
                <footer><span><strong data-student-plan>—</strong><small>Formule actuelle</small></span><span style="text-align:right"><strong><span data-student-remaining>—</span> / <span data-student-total>—</span></strong><small>Crédits actifs</small></span></footer>
              </article>
            </section>

            <section class="student-grid">
              <article class="next-step-card cp-card cp-glass">
                <header class="card-head"><div><p class="cp-eyebrow">Prochaine étape</p><h3>Une action à la fois.</h3></div><span class="cp-status amber" data-preparation-badge>Environ 3 minutes</span></header>
                <div class="next-step-content"><span class="next-step-number">01</span><div><h3 data-next-title>Prépare ta prochaine séance.</h3><p data-next-copy>Quelques réponses courtes permettront à Romain de reprendre le fil sans perdre les premières minutes de votre échange.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="cp-button small" data-next-action href="/coaching/preparation">Commencer ma préparation</a></div></div></div>
              </article>
              <article class="cp-card cp-glass">
                <header class="card-head"><div><p class="cp-eyebrow">Ton coach</p><h3>Le même fil, séance après séance.</h3></div></header>
                <div class="coach-mini"><img data-coach-avatar src="/media/coachs/romain.webp?v=ai-hd" alt="Romain" width="51" height="51" /><span><strong data-coach-name>Romain</strong><small>Ton coach reçoit ta préparation avant la séance. Ses notes privées restent dans son espace professionnel.</small></span></div>
              </article>
            </section>

            <section class="student-actions" aria-label="Actions rapides">
              <a class="student-action cp-glass" href="/coaching/preparation"><span><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8"></path></svg></span><strong>Préparer ma séance</strong><p>Répondre aux quelques questions qui permettront d’aller plus vite à l’essentiel.</p><b>Ouvrir la préparation →</b></a>
              <a class="student-action green cp-glass" href="/coaching/reserver"><span><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"></rect><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 10h18"></path></svg></span><strong>Choisir un créneau</strong><p>Réserver la prochaine séance avec l’un de tes crédits disponibles.</p><b>Voir les disponibilités →</b></a>
              <a class="student-action purple cp-glass" href="/coaching/credits"><span><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7H14a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg></span><strong>Garder du coaching en réserve</strong><p>Choisir un membership ou ajouter des crédits ponctuels à ton wallet.</p><b>Ajouter des crédits →</b></a>
            </section>

            <section class="cp-card cp-glass" id="historique" style="margin-top:14px">
              <header class="card-head"><div><p class="cp-eyebrow">Mon parcours</p><h3>Les étapes déjà franchies.</h3></div><span class="cp-status">Historique personnel</span></header>
              <div class="timeline" data-student-history></div>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <div class="continuation-prompt" data-continuation-prompt aria-hidden="true">
      <button class="continuation-prompt-backdrop" type="button" data-prompt-close aria-label="Fermer"></button>
      <section class="continuation-prompt-card cp-glass" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="continuation-title">
        <button class="prompt-close" type="button" data-prompt-close aria-label="Fermer">×</button>
        <span class="prompt-icon"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>
        <p class="cp-eyebrow">Séance terminée</p>
        <h2 id="continuation-title">Protège ce qui vient <em>de bouger.</em></h2>
        <p>Le meilleur moment pour choisir la suite, c’est quand l’intention est encore claire. Programme ta continuité ou garde simplement quelques crédits en réserve.</p>
        <div class="prompt-balance"><b data-prompt-balance>—</b><span><strong>crédits disponibles</strong><small data-prompt-time>Solde actuel</small></span></div>
        <div class="prompt-actions"><a class="cp-button green" href="/coaching/credits#membership">Voir les memberships</a><a class="cp-button secondary" href="/coaching/credits#recharges">Ajouter des crédits</a></div>
        <button class="prompt-later" type="button" data-prompt-close>Je déciderai plus tard</button>
      </section>
    </div>
    <nav class="mobile-nav cp-glass"><a class="active" href="#accueil"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect></svg>Accueil</a><a href="/coaching/preparation"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12"></path></svg>Préparer</a><a href="/coaching/credits"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7H14"></path></svg>Crédits</a><a href="/coaching/compte"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg>Compte</a></nav>
    <script>
      import '../../scripts/coaching-student.js';
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
